ne_sq"},"code":"/-- `tr ((B - l • 1)⁻¹ * (B - l • 1)⁻¹) = ∑ i, (λ i - l)⁻¹ ^ 2` for a symmetric matrix `B` with\neigenvalues `λ i` and `l` outside its spectrum. -/\nlemma IsHermitian.trace_inv_sub_smul_one_sq (hB : B.IsHermitian)\n    (hl : ∀ x ∈ spectrum ℝ B, x ≠ l) :\n    ((B - l • 1)⁻¹ * (B - l • 1)⁻¹).trace = ∑ i, (hB.eigenvalues i - l)⁻¹ ^ 2","proof":":= by\n  rw [hB.inv_sub_smul_one_eq_cfc hl, ← cfc_mul _ _ B (continuousOn_spectrum_real _ _)\n    (continuousOn_spectrum_real _ _), hB.trace_cfc_real]\n  simp_rw [sq]","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/Mathlib/Matrix/HermitianCFC.lean","start":129,"end":136,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/Mathlib/Matrix/HermitianCFC.lean#L129-L136"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommMonoid.toAddMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Algebra.id","mathlib","instance"],["CommRing.toNonUnitalCommRing","mathlib","instance"],["DecidableEq","lean4","definition"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["Finset.sum","mathlib","definition"],["Finset.univ","mathlib","definition"],["Fintype","mathlib","class"],["HMul.hMul","lean4","definition"],["HPow.hPow","lean4","definition"],["HSMul.hSMul","lean4","definition"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["Inv.inv","lean4","definition"],["InvolutiveStar.toStar","mathlib","instance"],["Matrix","mathlib","definition"],["Matrix.IsHermitian","mathlib","definition"],["Matrix.IsHermitian.eigenvalues","mathlib","definition"],["Matrix.instAlgebra","mathlib","instance"],["Matrix.instHMulOfFintypeOfMulOfAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Matrix.instRing","mathlib","instance"],["Matrix.inv","mathlib","instance"],["Matrix.one","mathlib","instance"],["Matrix.smul","mathlib","instance"],["Matrix.sub","mathlib","instance"],["Matrix.trace","mathlib","definition"],["Membership.mem","lean4","definition"],["Monoid.toNPow","mathlib","instance"],["NPow.toPow","mathlib","instance"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Ne","lean4","definition"],["NonUnit